          "line_end": 49,
          "line_start": 49,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "paoloanzn/microcodex",
          "url": "https://github.com/paoloanzn/microcodex/blob/2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7/README.md#L49-L49"
        },
        {
          "commit": "2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7",
          "git_sha": "277f579cef90e2bbb009d9569865de9b368d20b9",
          "line_end": 56,
          "line_start": 53,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "paoloanzn/microcodex",
          "url": "https://github.com/paoloanzn/microcodex/blob/2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7/README.md#L53-L56"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3edadce8595de117155781412cbbe8bb5c382221e65a2eec896296fc67ee8ce7",
        "slc_bc82046ceca4f4b38e0617c8629e8f6bf81397eed844c497ec58489dbafaf813"
      ],
      "text": "Users sign in with `microcodex login` (a `--device-auth` option exists for remote or headless machines) and can run interactively or pass a one-shot prompt as an argument."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d639afff502118d2d83cba42a52c2925f46745400f888d15e7de03211be245a1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
