      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_15a00bb676c03a3f1046046d0953c0f9d356db00de174873df7652ecdb473c18",
        "slc_8e0dae417002893a5495b04786647d1112f06f3dca67f87523e0408453f8cfd4",
        "slc_96b14b95e9e14d7ca57e6ac8e49bde6ff18b3d9772bb25eed15db720e98a37fa",
        "slc_f6e1a890a29ecd5ac6661b996139a3da1461db1da9c6d07490f6bfac767d8ded"
      ],
      "text": "Installation is via a curl-piped install script (with `MICROCODEX_RELEASE` selecting a specific release) or by downloading a platform archive from GitHub Releases."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2c5a4bb56f1348950c2f8fe10bc20b679ce23821e6f65b0d82ef20c4fddcedcc",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7",
          "git_sha": "277f579cef90e2bbb009d9569865de9b368d20b9",
          "line_end": 64,
          "line_start": 58,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "paoloanzn/microcodex",
          "url": "https://github.com/paoloanzn/microcodex/blob/2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7/README.md#L58-L64"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_f1b825334662dac14ae03157ff4d71897d38e8a9ae2d00cfb905df39d7cec1cc"
      ],
      "text": "The agent is not a sandbox: before running the user's shell it applies a lexical denylist (e.g. `rm -rf`, `git reset --hard`, shutdown commands); other commands and file operations run with the process's own permissions."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f6c9da148f3d567b09251d5165f15d2c3809c54f9073e0e310a869a28ccc225e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7",
          "git_sha": "277f579cef90e2bbb009d9569865de9b368d20b9",
          "line_end": 92,
          "line_start": 89,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "paoloanzn/microcodex",
          "url": "https://github.com/paoloanzn/microcodex/blob/2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7/README.md#L89-L92"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_438bdc1ef76597a8e1e8a8e05922587520448fa6609136225927917e89872be6"
      ],
      "text": "Documented known issues include unimplemented MCP support, inability to copy text from the terminal during use, and a bash safety gate that may miss indirect or unrecognized destructive commands."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a80d3c7460f983b1f820ed26f27f962f064c2f8c11f4218fc7c8687b5ed4a81c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "skills-patterns",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7",
          "git_sha": "277f579cef90e2bbb009d9569865de9b368d20b9",
          "line_end": 73,
          "line_start": 68,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "paoloanzn/microcodex",
          "url": "https://github.com/paoloanzn/microcodex/blob/2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7/README.md#L68-L73"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_419fba7dd4bc4a13e951da11dd5a25b604874b56389d4cd4d24e6ea417a95bc7"
      ],
      "text": "Skills are discovered under `$CODEX_HOME/skills` (default `~/.codex/skills`); each needs a `SKILL.md` with YAML frontmatter name and description, and the full skill is read only when its metadata matches the task."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_814b5eff35a095df5a6df22fcac21d114de019fe310cabc542827004c887126b",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7",
          "git_sha": "277f579cef90e2bbb009d9569865de9b368d20b9",
          "line_end": 49,
          "line_start": 49,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "paoloanzn/microcodex",
          "url": "https://github.com/paoloanzn/microcodex/blob/2d88e4f57552a91a98c9018ae76101148f5002c7/README.md#L49-L49"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3edadce8595de117155781412cbbe8bb5c382221e65a2eec896296fc67ee8ce7"
      ],
      "text": "OAuth credentials from login are stored under `$CODEX_HOME`, or `~/.codex` when that variable is unset."
    },
